Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.06,0:00:01.45,Caption,,0,0,0,,Number three: a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.47,0:00:03.01,Caption,,0,0,0,,guardrail that spins.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.43,0:00:04.29,Caption,,0,0,0,,It's a rolling
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.31,0:00:05.25,Caption,,0,0,0,,barrier made in
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.26,0:00:06.36,Caption,,0,0,0,,South Korea for
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.37,0:00:07.61,Caption,,0,0,0,,dangerous curves.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.03,0:00:08.71,Caption,,0,0,0,,Hit a plain
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.73,0:00:09.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,steel rail and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.63,0:00:10.45,Caption,,0,0,0,,it scrapes and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.46,0:00:11.13,Caption,,0,0,0,,drags at
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.15,0:00:11.73,Caption,,0,0,0,,the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.15,0:00:13.18,Caption,,0,0,0,,These rollers are
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.20,0:00:14.23,Caption,,0,0,0,,barrels of tough
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.24,0:00:14.73,Caption,,0,0,0,,foam on
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.74,0:00:15.79,Caption,,0,0,0,,steel posts.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.21,0:00:16.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,When a car
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.90,0:00:17.85,Caption,,0,0,0,,slides into them,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.13,0:00:19.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,they spin instead
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.18,0:00:19.91,Caption,,0,0,0,,of scraping.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.33,0:00:21.55,Caption,,0,0,0,,The foam squashes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.57,0:00:22.19,Caption,,0,0,0,,to soak up
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.21,0:00:22.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,the hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.08,0:00:23.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,And the spinning
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.89,0:00:24.75,Caption,,0,0,0,,turns part of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.77,0:00:25.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,the crash
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.39,0:00:26.35,Caption,,0,0,0,,into rotation.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.77,0:00:27.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,So the car
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.53,0:00:28.91,Caption,,0,0,0,,keeps rolling forward
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.92,0:00:29.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,and is steered
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.80,0:00:30.36,Caption,,0,0,0,,back toward
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.38,0:00:30.97,Caption,,0,0,0,,its lane.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.39,0:00:32.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,One version passed
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.64,0:00:33.87,Caption,,0,0,0,,a sixty-two mile
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.89,0:00:34.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,an hour crash
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.78,0:00:35.34,Caption,,0,0,0,,test for
